menu "EgoLink SIM7670 P0 delivery adapter"

config EGOLINK_SIM7670_P0_DELIVERY_TEST_DRIVER_ENABLED
    bool "Allow injected P0 delivery driver in offline test builds"
    default n
    help
        Unit-test-only seam for deterministic fake-driver contract checks.
        Ordinary firmware must keep this disabled and use the built-in exact
        driver, which remains fail-closed until OPS-004 integrates reviewed
        modem CA, hostname/SNI and clock verification. This option must not be
        enabled in a flashed or field image.

endmenu
